@startuml
title 4.4 COD Order and Confirmation Page - sequence diagram
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam wrapWidth 240
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ParticipantBorderColor #444444
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}

actor Customer as U
actor "Shop Manager" as M
participant "View" as V <<View>> #EADCFF
participant OrderController as C <<Controller>> #D8F3DC
participant OrderService as S <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant PaymentRepository as PR <<Repository>> #FFF1C9
participant NotificationService as N <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant OrderMailSender as MAIL <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant CustomerOrderController as COC <<Controller>> #D8F3DC
participant CustomerOrderService as COS <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant OrderRepository as OR <<Repository>> #FFF1C9
participant OrderDetailRepository as DR <<Repository>> #FFF1C9
participant ProductImageRepository as IR <<Repository>> #FFF1C9
participant PaymentTimeoutScheduler as T <<Scheduler>> #FFE8CC
participant SePayGatewayService as SP <<Service>> #DCECFF

== A. Place a COD order ==
U -> V : choose "Cash on delivery", click "Confirm COD order"
V -> C : POST /api/orders/{userId}/batch\n(paymentMethod = COD, shops[] ...)
C -> S : makeOrders(userId, request)
note right of S
  Order, details, stock, vouchers and cart cleanup follow 4.3.
  Below is only what is specific to COD, done for each shop's order.
end note
S -> S : Order saved as PENDING (shipping fee included in totalAmount)
S -> PR : save(Payment: FULL, COD, amount = totalAmount,\ninvoiceNumber "COD-" + 8 chars of the order id, PENDING)
S -> N : notifyOrderPlaced(order)
N -> N : bell notification to the customer "Đặt hàng thành công"
N -> N : bell notification to the shop owner "Có đơn hàng mới"
S -> S : publish OrderPlacedEvent(orderIds)
S --> C : List<OrderResponse>
C --> V : 201 Created
S --> MAIL : OrderPlacedEvent, after the transaction commits
MAIL -> MAIL : one receipt mail for the whole checkout, skipped without a verified email (13.3)

== B. Confirmation page ==
V -> V : reload the cart (ordered items are gone), badge updated
V -> V : go to /payment/cod-success?order=<id>&order=<id>
V -> COC : GET /api/customer/orders/by-ids?ids=<id>,<id>
COC -> COS : byIds(customerId, ids)
loop each distinct id (at most 20)
  COS -> OR : findById(id)
  OR --> COS : Order (kept only when it belongs to this customer)
  COS -> DR : findByOrderId(id)
  DR --> COS : details
  COS -> IR : findByProductIdInOrderByDisplayOrderAscIdAsc(productIds)
  IR --> COS : images
end
COS --> COC : List<OrderSummary>
COC --> V : 200 OK
V --> U : "Order created" (one line per order with a link to /orders/{id}),\ntotal of all orders when there are several, buttons to the order list

== C. After the order ==
note over T, SP
  PaymentTimeoutScheduler also scans PENDING orders; expireUnpaidOrder() returns at once
  when the order has a COD payment, so a COD order is never cancelled for non-payment.
end note
M -> V : open the order queue, confirm the order (3.2)
note right of M
  The shop confirms, creates the GHN waybill (3.3) and the customer follows the order (9.2).
  The customer can still cancel while the order has not been handed to GHN (9.3).
end note
U -> V : open the order list, status PENDING until the shop confirms

@enduml
